Package: cadviewer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TerraMaster <support@terra-master.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/YOUR-ORG/YOUR-REPO
Description: CAD Viewer for TOS 7
 View and inspect 3D models and CAD files (STEP, IGES, BREP, IFC, STL, OBJ,
 PLY, 3MF, GLTF/GLB, FBX, DAE, 3DS, WRL, OFF, AMF) directly in the browser.
 All parsing is performed locally on the TNAS; no cloud service is used.
 .
 Based on Online 3D Viewer by Viktor Kovacs (MIT). See licenses/NOTICE.md.
